// Plan and credits
cfg_tab_plan#:#Plan & credits
plan_section#:#Subscription
plan_section_desc#:#The package the customer booked, as in the Tarsus partner agreement. The partner sets it; it decides which features the objects offer – a customer reaches only what was booked – and how usage is priced. Each package contains the one before it.
plan#:#Plan
plan_learn#:#Build Knowledge (LEARN)
plan_learn_desc#:#The full AI coach: Ask a question, Test knowledge, Build knowledge with the audio explainer, voice input and the agent mode (AI-driven interaction). Includes a monthly amount of AI interactions; further interactions are charged per interaction.
plan_practice#:#Knowledge Test (PRACTICE)
plan_practice_desc#:#Ask a question and Test knowledge (adaptive quizzes). No Build knowledge, no audio explainer, no voice input, trainer-driven interaction only. Includes a monthly amount of AI interactions; further interactions are charged per interaction.
plan_ask#:#Ask Question (ASK)
plan_ask_desc#:#Ask a question only: the AI answers from the documents. Trainer-driven interaction only. Includes a monthly amount of AI interactions; further interactions are charged per interaction.
plan_payg#:#Pay as you grow
plan_payg_desc#:#Access to everything, nothing included: every AI interaction is charged at the agreed price.
plan_credits#:#Included AI interactions per month
plan_credits_desc#:#The AI interactions (AI credits) the package includes per calendar month (default {default}). Unused interactions do not carry over. Not used on Pay as you grow.
plan_price#:#Price per additional AI interaction
plan_price_desc#:#What one AI interaction beyond the included amount costs (default {default}, the flat partner price). On Pay as you grow, the price of every interaction. Not applied to customers with a Tarsus license key – Tarsus bills them directly.
plan_currency#:#Currency
plan_current#:#Current plan
plan_default_note#:#not yet configured, Build Knowledge assumed
plan_not_set_hint#:#The booked package is not set yet, so every feature is reachable ({plan} assumed). The partner agreement asks you to enforce the booked package here:
plan_billing#:#Billing
plan_billing_partner#:#By the partner, at the prices above (partner customer)
plan_billing_tarsus#:#By Tarsus directly – the customer has a Tarsus license key; the partner's prices do not apply
plan_included_value_tarsus#:#{credits} AI interactions per month; what lies beyond is billed by Tarsus
plan_payg_note_tarsus#:#Nothing included: Tarsus bills every AI interaction
plan_features_title#:#Features per package (partner agreement)
plan_features_desc#:#What each package includes. A customer reaches only what was booked; the plugin locks the rest in the object settings, the learner's mode switch and the server-side checks.
plan_feature#:#Feature
plan_ask_short#:#Ask Question
plan_practice_short#:#Knowledge Test
plan_learn_short#:#Build Knowledge
plan_payg_short#:#Pay as you grow
plan_feature_ask#:#Ask a question: the AI answers from the documents
plan_feature_test#:#Test knowledge: the AI creates and marks quizzes
plan_feature_build#:#Build knowledge: the AI coach explains step by step
plan_feature_audio_explainer#:#Audio explainer in the AI coach
plan_feature_voice_input#:#Voice input in the AI coach
plan_feature_ai_driven#:#Agent mode (AI-driven interaction type)
