counting_title#:#How AI interactions are counted
counting_desc#:#Every request in which the AI answers, creates, marks, voices or indexes something is one AI interaction. Audio plus another AI step counts twice; “think longer” doubles any request. This installation records these figures for every call it makes; what the brain actually charged is fetched separately and wins when it is higher.
