counting_count#:#AI interactions
counting_answer#:#Answer a question (Ask a question)
counting_step#:#Create the next learning step: explanation, slide or quiz question
counting_agent#:#Agent mode: the AI steers the learning flow (per request)
counting_audio_explainer#:#Audio explainer of a learning unit
counting_voice#:#Spoken question or answer (audio file)
counting_eval_open#:#Mark an open question, a rule of three or a spreadsheet calculation, with feedback
counting_eval_choice#:#Correct a single-choice or true/false answer
counting_index#:#Index text, a table, a question, a URL, a document or an image (per request)
counting_index_media#:#Index audio or video (per started two hours)
counting_management#:#Manage keys and brains, read the usage, retrieve, list, check, release, edit or delete content
counting_note#:#The public overview without prices is at tarsus.ai/ki-interaktionen.
